w, not as a definition of any field.\n\\end{definition}\n\\begin{proof}\n  This is the typed definition of the stated physical carrier; its fields or defining equation provide the claimed data.\n\\end{proof}\n\n\\begin{definition}[Declaration ToroidalAmpereLaw]\n  \\label{def:physics:IPhO_2026_3_A_1:aux018}\n  \\lean{IPhO2026Problems.IPhO2026_3_A_1.ToroidalAmpereLaw}\n  \\uses{def:physics:IPhO_2026_3_A_1:aux009, def:physics:IPhO_2026_3_A_1:aux013, def:physics:IPhO_2026_3_A_1:aux014, def:physics:IPhO_2026_3_A_1:aux015, def:physics:IPhO_2026_3_A_1:aux016}\n  Amp\u00e8re's circuital law reduced using the approximately uniform toroidal field: the circulation H (2\u03c0R) equals the enclosed free current N I.\n\\end{definition}\n\\begin{proof}\n  This is the typed definition of the stated physical carrier; its fields or defining equation provide the claimed data.\n\\end{proof}\n% --- Archon physics formalization source end ---\nIPhO2026Problems/problem_IPhO_2026_3_A_1.lean:155:  sorry\nblueprint/src/chapters/IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_3_A_1.tex:4:% archon:source-report reports/ipho_2026/problem_IPhO_2026_3_A_1.source.json\nblueprint/src/chapters/IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_3_A_1.tex:32:create a compiling Lean file with sorry bodies at `IPhO2026Problems/problem\\_IPhO\\_2026\\_3\\_A\\_1.lean`. The Lean declarations must preserve the physical quantities, dimensions or dimensional roles, figure labels, governing-law hypotheses, and final relation expressed by this problem.\nreferences/summary.md\nreports/ipho_2026/problem_IPhO_2026_1_A_1.source.json\nreports/ipho_2026/problem_IPhO_2026_1_B_1.source.json\nreports/ipho_2026/problem_IPhO_2026_1_B_2.source.json\nreports/ipho_2026/problem_IPhO_2026_1_C_1.source.json\nreports/ipho_2026/problem_IPhO_2026_1_C_2.source.json\nreports/ipho_2026/problem_IPhO_2026_2_A_1.source.json\nreports/ipho_2026/problem_IPhO_2026_2_B_1.source.json\nreports/ipho_2026/problem_IPhO_2026_2_B_2.source.json\nreports/ipho_2026/problem_IPhO_